OL,3,GNEWSADanny Boyle: Film about The Sun
OL,4,A'doesn't shy away' from Hillsborough
OL,5,
OL,6,FFilm director Danny Boyle said his new
OL,7,Ffilm about the rise of The Sun
OL,8,Fnewspaper does not shy away from its
OL,9,Fcoverage of the Hillsborough disaster.
OL,11,FThe Oscar-winning director from Bury
OL,12,Fsaid the 1989 headline 'The Truth',
OL,13,Fwhich falsely blamed Liverpool fans for
OL,14,Fthe tragedy, was "one of the darkest
OL,15,Fdays in publishing history".
OL,17,FBoyle made the comments at a screening
OL,18,Fof Ink in Manchester ahead of the
OL,19,Ffilm's release next year.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
