OL,3,GNEWSADanny Boyle: Film about The Sun
OL,4,A'doesn't shy away' from Hillsborough
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe film, due to stream on Netflix next
OL,7,Fyear, stars Guy Pearce as media mogul
OL,8,FRupert Murdoch, Jack O'Connell as
OL,9,Feditor Larry Lamb and Claire Foy as a
OL,10,Freporter.
